# This repo's theme (Kal_Booking_Flow_Preetham/main) is connected to this
# GitHub branch via Shopify's own GitHub integration — running `shopify
# theme dev` against it auto-commits back to this branch, and that sync
# only knows about actual theme files (assets/sections/snippets/
# templates/config/locales/layout). It treats anything outside that as
# not belonging to the theme and deletes it on the next auto-sync — which
# kept erasing docs/*.md every time theme dev ran. Ignoring docs/ here
# keeps reference notes local instead of fighting that sync every push.
docs/
